* news_process v3.5.0 — Table A6: Dual-track Residual Robustness (D4)
*
* ⚠ 归档说明 (archive note): 本文件是 v3.5.0 历史归档模板, 已被废弃 (superseded)。
*   现行主线的 25_tableA6 是 ../25_tableA6_tone_iv_2sls.do.tmpl (tone IV 2SLS), 与本文件
*   内容无关, 仅共用 "25_tableA6" 编号。build-replication 对根目录非递归 glob → 本归档文件
*   不会被实例化, 无运行期冲突; 此处仅消除"同号不同义"的阅读/归档陷阱。
*
* Per v3.5.0 Stage-3 augmentation plan §2.3 (历史方法学文档, 已随 docs/ 目录删除归档):
*   全文判定 (full) 与 entity-context 判定 (ctx) 的 differential signals:
*     - disagree: full ≠ ctx 的文章占比
*     - freerider: full=baseline ∧ ctx=contrast (文章宏观叙事强但目标银行只是边角)
*     - quietworker: full=contrast ∧ ctx=baseline (PR fluff 包装但目标银行实质动作)
*
* 文献锚 (per plan §10):
*   作者自创 measure (v3.5.0 新增, no prior literature)
*   Loughran & McDonald (2011 JF) tone-vs-context differential 类比借用
*   Westphal & Zajac (2001 ASQ) decoupling 类比借用到 narrative-context 层面
*
* 小样本限制 (per plan §2.3.3): panel n_articles < 5 → *_frac 强制置 NA.
* ctx coverage 自适应警告 (per plan §2.3.4): d4_data_quality_flag str column 标 'ok' / 'insufficient'.
*
* 三种用法 (per plan §2.3.6):
*   1. 作 robustness control: 主回归加 *_disagree_frac 控制变量, 洗 PR-only 噪音
*   2. 作 outcome: 测政策冲击是否让 freerider 报道占比变多
*   3. 作 moderator: het cut by quietworker_frac 中位数

version 19
clear all
set linesize 120

use "{{ panel_path }}", clear

* --- D4 数据质量过滤 (per plan §2.3.4 F6) ---
* Stata 端可见 d4_data_quality_flag (str col); 不可信 ctx coverage 时排除
capture confirm variable d4_data_quality_flag
if !_rc {
    display as text "d4_data_quality_flag levels:"
    tab d4_data_quality_flag, missing
    * 默认: 仅保留 'ok' 样本 (insufficient ctx coverage 排除).
    * Paper authors 可在 paper_spec.yaml 配置 disable-filter 来用全部样本.
    keep if d4_data_quality_flag == "ok" | d4_data_quality_flag == ""
}

* --- Robustness Spec 1: 主回归加 disagree_frac 控制 ---
eststo M_disagree: reghdfe {{ outcome }} {{ treatment }} ///
    subst_disagree_frac locus_disagree_frac collab_disagree_frac ///
    {{ controls }} [aw={{ weight }}], ///
    absorb(i.{{ bank_fe }} i.{{ year_fe }}) cluster({{ cluster_var }})

* --- Robustness Spec 2: 主回归加 freerider + quietworker 4 列 (3 dim × 2 dir, drop 1 ref) ---
eststo M_residual: reghdfe {{ outcome }} {{ treatment }} ///
    subst_freerider_frac subst_quietworker_frac ///
    locus_freerider_frac locus_quietworker_frac ///
    collab_freerider_frac collab_quietworker_frac ///
    {{ controls }} [aw={{ weight }}], ///
    absorb(i.{{ bank_fe }} i.{{ year_fe }}) cluster({{ cluster_var }})

* --- 输出合并表 ---
esttab M_disagree M_residual using "{{ output_dir }}/table_A6_residual.tex", ///
    cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) ///
    label nogaps ///
    title("Table A6: Dual-track Residual Robustness (D4)") ///
    mtitle("+ disagree control" "+ freerider/quietworker") ///
    addnotes("D4 measure 作者自创; 类比借用 Loughran-McDonald 2011 + W&Z 2001 decoupling." ///
             "small-sample restriction: panel n_articles < 5 → *_frac forced NA." ///
             "d4_data_quality_flag='ok' samples only.")

* standalone (clear all + 自 use panel) → 终端 exit 防双击弹「Done」完成框
exit, clear
